WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:17.900
Welcome to Tenali. Your products, bills, stock, accounts and own online
shop stay together. Let us begin with your AI helper, then walk through
everyday tasks at a comfortable pace.

00:18.000 --> 00:34.900
Open Tenali AI and choose New chat. Type what you need in the Message box.
You can also ask for help beside your work. AI must be enabled for your
business.

00:35.000 --> 00:53.900
For a purchase, ask AI to prepare the supplier, product and bill together.
Attach the bill if needed. Review every proposed step, check missing
details, then confirm only the work you want saved.

00:54.000 --> 01:11.900
To prepare a product list, select Prepare product bulk workbook and attach
your catalogue. Download the reply's ZIP. Review its Excel sheet and
product pictures, then upload it through Bulk Upload.

01:12.000 --> 01:27.900
In Accounts, give each money account a clear nickname, such as Shop cash or
Business bank. Choose its type and enter the opening balance once: the
money already there when you start.

01:28.000 --> 01:46.900
Account Tally shows opening money, money received, money paid and the
current balance. Compare cash with your counted drawer and bank with your
statement. Record an internal transfer once, not as a sale.

01:47.000 --> 02:04.900
Open Borrowing and Settlements. Select the contact, choose Borrowed from
party, and enter the amount and date. Choose the account receiving the
money if you also want its money entry recorded.

02:05.000 --> 02:22.900
For money you give someone to return later, choose Lent to party. Select
the contact, amount, date and paying account. Review the direction
carefully: lending is different from paying a supplier bill.

02:23.000 --> 02:40.900
When returning borrowed money, choose Repaid to party. When someone returns
money you lent, choose Collected from party. Enter only the amount moving
today, then check the remaining balance and history.

02:41.000 --> 03:00.900
Open Purchases. Select the vendor, store, bill date and supplier's bill
number. Add the products, quantities and buying prices. If you paid
something now, enter that amount and the paying account.

03:01.000 --> 03:17.900
If all the listed goods have arrived, select Goods received now before
posting. Otherwise leave it off and confirm receipt later. Recording a bill
and receiving the goods are separate checks.

03:18.000 --> 03:34.900
Under Stores and Warehouses, add each shop or warehouse with a short code
and clear name. Choose the right store on sales, purchases and stock
movements so each location's quantity stays meaningful.

03:35.000 --> 03:52.900
For an online store, choose Online store as the kind and link its
fulfilment shop or warehouse. This is the location supplying those orders.
Shops can separately allow customers to collect orders.

03:53.000 --> 04:13.900
Open the three-line menu. Admin contains Company Setup, Stores and
Warehouses, Users and Roles, Storefront Design, domains, policies, and
payment setup. Owners and administrators manage these settings and team
access.

04:14.000 --> 04:34.900
Operations contains your everyday tools: contacts, accounts, borrowing,
purchases, sales, receivables, products and reports. The Operations Portal
also has start-of-day and closing checklists to help you remember important
checks.

04:35.000 --> 04:53.900
On Dashboard, choose the dates and store you want to check. Review sales,
money received, unpaid amounts, pending purchases and low stock. Open the
relevant work area when a figure needs attention.

04:54.000 --> 05:12.900
New to Tenali? Choose Set up my business and a sign-in option, then add
your business name and workspace address. Already registered? Choose Sign
in and open your existing business instead.

05:13.000 --> 05:29.900
In Company Setup, enter your name, address, phone and email. GST off means
sales documents have no GST. Turn it on and enter your GSTIN only for a
GST-registered business.

05:30.000 --> 05:49.900
In Product Inventory, choose Add Product. Enter a recognisable name, such
as Steel water bottle. SKU is your own short item code; we use BOTTLE-01.
Avoid adding the same item twice.

05:50.000 --> 06:07.900
Choose or type the brand and category. Select a saved HSN code when needed;
its description and GST rate fill from that saved record. Check these
values match the product before continuing.

06:08.000 --> 06:25.900
Choose Keep catalog price and enter 250 in Catalog Price. This is the
catalogue selling price for our sample bottle. The supplier's buying price
is a different number, recorded with purchases.

06:26.000 --> 06:45.900
Choose a picture file or enter its public image link. Aim for a square,
one-thousand-pixel product picture under one megabyte. Choose a background
in ordinary colour names. Review, then save the product.

06:46.000 --> 07:03.900
In Owned Stock, choose the store and Stock In. Enter 24 and the reason
Opening stock. Record the movement once. Saving a product alone does not
put any physical bottles into stock.

07:04.000 --> 07:24.900
Open Bulk Upload and choose the record type. Download its template, then
fill the Data sheet. README explains every column. Use the fresh template
to include current dropdown choices and dependent saved details.

07:25.000 --> 07:47.900
For web pictures, fill image URL. For local files, enter each filename and
ZIP manifest.xlsx with an images folder. Brand and category templates
support pictures too. Product rows can include their matching brand and
category images.

07:48.000 --> 08:09.900
Upload the workbook or ZIP. The page shows successful, failed and remaining
rows as processing continues. Download results. Read failure reasons,
correct only failed rows, then retry them without uploading successful rows
again.

08:10.000 --> 08:27.900
In Sales and Quotations, choose the customer. Add a missing customer using
the button provided. Check the invoice date, billing address, store and
place of supply before adding what you sold.

08:28.000 --> 08:45.900
Select Steel water bottle, enter quantity two and price two hundred and
fifty rupees. Our sample sale totals five hundred rupees with GST off.
Check the complete bill total before posting.

08:46.000 --> 09:02.900
The customer pays three hundred rupees now. Enter that in Amount Received
Now, choose cash as the payment mode and Shop cash as the receiving
account. Two hundred rupees is still due.

09:03.000 --> 09:21.900
Keep Auto-create receivable selected for the unpaid balance. Review the
bill, then choose Post Invoice once. Later, record the remaining two
hundred rupees in Receivables and Collections, against this bill.

09:22.000 --> 09:39.900
Back in Product Inventory, check stock by store and Stock History. We began
with twenty-four bottles and sold two, so twenty-two remain. The history
explains which movement changed the quantity.

09:40.000 --> 09:58.900
For a product to appear online, keep it active and select Visible in
customer catalog. Check the name, price, photo and available variants. Save
your changes, then view the shop as a customer.

09:59.000 --> 10:20.900
In Company Setup, open Storefront Design. Choose a theme, pictures and
wording. Selected products, brands and categories come first; the rest
follow unless you explicitly choose Show only selected. Preview before
saving.

10:21.000 --> 10:38.900
Share your Tenali shop link with customers. They can browse products and
pictures on their phone, choose variants and ask about items. Your website
is connected to the same product and stock records.

10:39.000 --> 10:58.900
Customers can collect several items into a WhatsApp enquiry list and send
quantities together. Use it to discuss bulk prices or availability. A
WhatsApp conversation does not create a paid order or reserve stock.

10:59.000 --> 11:17.900
To accept online purchases, open Payments and Delivery Setup and connect
your own Razorpay account. Start in Test Mode, complete the setup and
checks, then use approved live credentials for real customer payments.

11:18.000 --> 11:38.900
Choose your own delivery team or courier, or connect Shiprocket using its
dedicated API user and pickup location. Confirm delivery coverage and
charges. Online Orders is where you process orders and record dispatch or
collection.

11:39.000 --> 12:05.000
For your own web address, open Storefront Domains. Add a domain you own,
follow the displayed DNS instructions and verify it. Keep your email
records intact. Your existing Tenali shop link remains available. You can
return to any chapter whenever you need a reminder.
